    "summary": "As your [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) opens, mark one [objective marker](vsdata:core-rule/objectives) as Acquisition. Clear the designation when your next [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) begins. On an attack by one of your **ADEPTUS MECHANICUS** models, re-roll a 1 on the [Wound roll](vsdata:core-rule/making-attacks) if the attacker’s unit, the target, or both are in range of the designated marker.",
